WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:11.580
if you hear the signal for an air-raid alert&nbsp;
three minutes of short blasts on horns or on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:18.090
whistles or a three-minute wailing siren go at&nbsp;
once to your shelter area if you are in your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.090 --> 00:00:23.640
home go immediately to your basement shelter or&nbsp;
to a centrally located room you have prepared&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:30.300
previously turn off all electrical appliances&nbsp;
if however there is no alert your only warning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.880
will be a flash of light take whatever cover&nbsp;
is available instantly remember there will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:41.430
be only a few seconds between the flashlight&nbsp;
and the impact of the flash so you must act&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:47.610
instantly stay where you are until debris&nbsp;
has stopped falling the all-clear is a one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:47.610 --> 00:00:56.130
minute blast two minutes of silence another&nbsp;
blast another silence and a third black

